egistered cut's; the per-expert cut's own is 5.53e+08 marginal end to end, 1.7e+09 at full statements. Every block's overhead is at verity.hardware.rate's peak, 9.8943e+14 MAC/s (the registered blocks' rescaled from the data sheet's 9.8945e+14).",
